## Command

```shell
biome migrate stylelint --include-inspired --include-nursery
```

## `biome.json`

```json
{ "linter": { "enabled": true } }
```

## `.stylelintrc.json`

```json
{
        "plugins": ["stylelint-scss"],
        "rules": {
            "scss/dollar-variable-no-missing-interpolation": true
        }
    }
```

